error[E0277]: `NonZero<u8>` has no bitwise operations in a field
  --> tests/compile_fail/field_bitwise_without_the_capability.rs:23:26
   |
23 |     quote.fields().owner.or(owner, Relaxed);
   |                          ^^ `and`, `or`, `xor`, `not` and their `fetch_` forms on a field need `FieldBitwise`
   |
   = help: the trait `FieldBitwise` is not implemented for `NonZero<u8>`
   = note: and, or and xor on the field's bits could leave a pattern that is no `NonZero<u8>`
   = note: to change the field in a compare-exchange loop, call `update`
note: required by a bound in `AtomicField::<P>::or`
  --> src/atomic/field/mod.rs
   |
   | impl<P: FieldPath> AtomicField<P> {
...
   |     pub fn or<O: RmwOrdering>(&self, value: P::Value, order: O)
   |     where
   |         P::Value: FieldBitwise,
   |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `AtomicField::<P>::or`
